   107	## 5. Evaluation protocol (cells)
   108	
   109	Common flags for every generative cell: `--cond-method vanilla --cond-autocast bf16 --cfg-scale 1.0 --steps 1 --record-per-scene --record-stream --expected-stream-count <split size> --dump-scored-waveforms /media/diskstation/yixunhu/FLAC/exp25_pred_waveforms/<cell stem>`; batch 64; EMA (`weights_source: ema` recorded). `--frame-avg-angles` is NOT passed (inert under vanilla; record `null`). Evaluator pin = one commit for every cell of the campaign (recorded `source_sha`).
   110	
   111	| Block | Cells | Protocol flags (in addition to the common set) | Count |
   112	|---|---|---|---|
   113	| **T** table | CANON@40k × K{1,8} × seeds 42–46 | `--canonicalize --rotate-mode fixed --rotate-deg 0` | 10 |
   114	| **T-dup** repeatability floor | CANON@40k × K{1,8} × seed 42 (re-run) | as T, `--eval-name …_dup` | 2 |
   115	| **C4+45** | CANON@40k × K{1,8} × θ{90,180,270,45} × seed 42 | `--canonicalize --rotate-mode fixed --rotate-deg <θ>` | 8 |
   116	| **R** random yaw | CANON@40k × K{1,8} × seeds 42–46 | `--canonicalize --rotate-mode random --rotate-seed <seed>` | 10 |
   117	| **D-i** mismatch diag | CANON@40k × K{1,8} × seed 42, θ=0 | `--allow-canon-mismatch` (no `--canonicalize`) | 2 |
   118	| **D-ii** P1 + canon diag | P1@40k × K{1,8} × seed 42, θ=0 | `--canonicalize --allow-canon-mismatch` | 2 |
   119	| **S** seen split (D5a) | CANON@40k × K{1,8} × seeds 42–46, `acousticroom_seeneval{_1,}.json` (`--expected-stream-count` = seen size) | `--canonicalize --rotate-deg 0` | 10 |
   120	| **P1-pin** one-pin comparator (D5b) | P1@40k × K{1,8} × seeds 42–46: T (θ=0) + R (random) + C4/45 (seed 42) | no `--canonicalize` | 10 + 10 + 8 |
   121	| **YAW-pin** one-pin comparator (A1) | YAW@40k, same cells as P1-pin, plus S (seen, 10) | no `--canonicalize` | 10 + 10 + 8 + 10 |
   122	| **TRAJ** (D5c) | CANON ckpts 2.5k…40k (16) × θ{0,90,180,270} × K{1,8}, seed 42 (the 40k θ cells are the T/C4 cells) | `--canonicalize --rotate-deg <θ>` | 120 new |
   123	| **ε_cond** probe | `depth_canon_cond_probe.py`, 64 unseen items × 5 offsets, fp32, GPU | — | 1 script |
