   205	        # (plan §3.1). None means "the yaw_rotation module default (64)", which is
   206	        # what every recipe already in the record ran under; the value is PASSED to
   207	        # invariant_conditioning, never assigned to the module global. Validated
   208	        # raw here so direct construction is as fail-closed as the config path
   209	        # (the exp_15 yaw_aug precedent).
