   359	    ``eval_FLAC`` output, so exp_01 / exp_02 artifacts reproduce exactly. A
   360	    non-vanilla ``cond_method`` inserts ``_<cond_method>_a<n_angles>`` and a
   361	    non-zero ``rotate_deg`` appends ``_rot<int(rotate_deg)>``. Both suffixes now
   362	    also land on the predictions name -- fixing the exp_02 bug where two
