  1056	    augmentation schedule and regroups the evaluation tail batch — so this is
  1057	    what makes "legacy-loop" a checkable label rather than a footnote.
  1058	
  1059	    Under ``rotate_mode='random'`` (exp_14) the record additionally carries the
  1060	    §3.3 assignment provenance and nulls ``rotate_deg``; in fixed mode it is
  1061	    byte-identical to the legacy record. See :func:`_rotation_provenance`.
  1062	
