   707	def build_stream_record(plan, stream):
   708	    """The ``.stream.json`` payload: the assignment audit WITH its preimages.
   709	
   710	    A digest alone is unfalsifiable evidence --- it can declare two cells matched,
   711	    but when they do not match it cannot say where or why, and it cannot be
   712	    recomputed by anyone who does not already trust the writer (review B2). This
   713	    payload therefore carries the full ordered canonical tuples and the
   714	    per-position offsets, from which both hashes are recomputable, plus the
   715	    schema versions needed to read them under the right contract.
   716	
   717	    ``rotate_seed`` is null in fixed mode (nothing was drawn) and ``rotate_deg``
   718	    is null in random mode (no single angle describes the run) --- the same
   719	    asymmetry the metrics record uses, so the two never disagree.
   720	    """
