The central v2 issue is now clear: the full-image key is sound, but the terminal “stabilized” proof is not. Equality of a sorted azimuth multiset does not establish equality of the ordered pose rows—or of their pairing with unchanged `context_audio`—and the proposed all-roll selector test is mathematically impossible for `min(C)` on a true stabilizer. I’m checking the remaining plan consistency and evidence thresholds before assigning final severities.
